1
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:47,239
The largest Chinese enterprise in Antilocaris,

2
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:48,400
Plato Hotel,

3
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,640
will be the key focus of our security efforts.

4
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:53,200
I've already spoken with their headquarters.

5
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:56,079
We'll be taking charge of their security.

6
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,480
I was hoping to expand Zhong'an's footprint

7
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:03,159
here in Antilocaris myself.

8
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:04,920
You went and handled everything for me again.

9
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,040
What kind of talk is that?

10
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,960
To ensure Chinese enterprises

11
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:13,159
can thrive overseas with peace of mind,

12
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:16,719
Zhong'an Group still has a long way to go.

13
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:20,800
And you've got a heavy workload ahead, too.

14
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:22,639
Understood.

15
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,840
Anda, what's wrong?

16
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,599
I'm fine, just feeling a bit dizzy.

17
00:02:30,719 --> 00:02:32,319
That Mr. Xiao is unbelievable.

18
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:34,280
It was his own misconduct,

19
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,719
yet he pinned the blame on you.

20
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,280
You just took your regular annual leave,

21
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,840
and he stuck you at the front desk for a month.

22
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,560
That's completely ridiculous.

23
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,759
It's fine. I just need a little rest,

24
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,000
and I'll be fine by tomorrow.

25
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,960
Only you would be so easygoing.

26
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:02,879
Feichen.

27
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:03,599
Coming!

28
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,360
Should I serve the two bowls of noodles now?

29
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:07,759
Sure. Add extra pork belly slices.

30
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,560
No problem.

31
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:12,520
Wei Tian.

32
00:03:14,159 --> 00:03:14,960
Thank you.

33
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,919
Don't thank me yet.

34
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,159
Sign this.

35
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:29,759
I never hired you guys to protect me.

36
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,159
Why are you charging me so much?

37
00:03:32,599 --> 00:03:34,560
While you were acting foolish in the Muru Tribe,

38
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,039
I was back here helping you

39
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:37,599
defend the honor of Zhong'an Group.

40
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,960
Isn't that worth the price?

41
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:42,240
I never asked you to protect me.

42
00:03:42,479 --> 00:03:43,919
I'm not signing this.

43
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,439
Noodles are here!

44
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,319
Great.

45
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,680
Xingyun.

46
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:54,520
Here's your extra pork belly.

47
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:56,599
Called ahead to order it.

48
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,199
Thanks.

49
00:04:00,439 --> 00:04:01,240
Thank you.

50
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:03,319
He's paying for the noodles.

51
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,319
Put it on his tab.

52
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,240
You pay for it.

53
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,439
I'm telling you, I'm not paying.

54
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,199
Why should I?

55
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,120
Then who will?

56
00:04:13,879 --> 00:04:14,840
Whoever eats pays.

57
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,560
He's paying.

58
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,079
I'm listening to him. You pay.

59
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,680
Don't stand there. You're distracting us.

60
00:05:17,839 --> 00:05:19,680
Chess really is an art, isn't it?

61
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,920
I... I won't say a word.

62
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,240
Just... just watching you guys.

63
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,720
You just have to meddle in everything.

64
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,199
Where did Wei Tian go?

65
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,720
He went out, I think. No idea.

66
00:05:56,399 --> 00:05:57,800
No backing out, okay?

67
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:06,600
Not today. I'm completely off my game.

68
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:07,879
Of course you are.

69
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:09,600
Not with someone watching right here.

70
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:18,120
Sorry to intrude.

71
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:24,160
You should've left ages ago.

72
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:37,279
What are you doing? Why are you staring at me?

73
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,879
She shouldn't be here in the first place.

74
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,279
It's nothing.

75
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,720
For the first time,

76
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:44,720
I think you're pretty cute when you have a sharp tongue.

77
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,879
How about that? You lost, right? Convinced now?

78
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:52,560
No way, I clearly had a shot at winning back there.

79
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:54,319
It's not your fault, not your fault at all.

80
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:55,600
Someone interrupted you, after all.

81
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,519
I'm heading to training.

82
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,279
It's fine, it's nothing.

83
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,800
I... I dialed the wrong number just now.

84
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,279
Sorry to bother you.

85
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:07,600
Come on, just tell me what it is.

86
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,879
My last name isn't An or Bai,

87
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,839
nor do I have an English name.

88
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:12,399
What did you do to your phone

89
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:13,879
to accidentally call me?

90
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:18,920
I...

91
00:08:20,759 --> 00:08:21,720
I'm sorry.

92
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,839
You sound like you have something on your mind.

93
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:25,680
What's wrong?

94
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:27,519
Where are you? I'll pick you up.

95
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:42,159
Thank you all for taking care of me.

96
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,679
Sorry for causing you so much trouble.

97
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,639
You're right.

98
00:08:46,159 --> 00:08:47,320
I don't belong here.

99
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:49,200
I should go back where I belong.

100
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,960
Also, please tell Wei Tian...

101
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,039
...I said thank you.

102
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:22,960
Let me do it.

103
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,720
She doesn't look too happy.

104
00:09:38,679 --> 00:09:40,080
Who cares about her attitude?

105
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,840
What I mean is,

106
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,919
should we have her wait for Wei Tian to get back,

107
00:09:45,919 --> 00:09:47,639
and let her talk to Wei Tian herself?

108
00:09:48,759 --> 00:09:51,360
We really shouldn't hold up her important business.

109
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,320
What's wrong? Why so down?

110
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,440
Did someone bully you?

111
00:10:04,879 --> 00:10:06,159
Nobody bullied me.

112
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,600
I just can't seem to do anything right.

113
00:10:08,919 --> 00:10:10,799
I feel completely useless.

114
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:12,840
Don't say that.

115
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:14,600
Everyone making it back safely

116
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,840
is already a blessing.

117
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:18,919
Thank you, Xiang Lai.

118
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,200
You coming out to see me

119
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,960
shows you truly trust me.

120
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:24,240
That's the spirit.

121
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,200
After all, Zhong'an Group

122
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:28,039
is a top-tier security firm.

123
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,360
It's all thanks to you guys.

124
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,639
Otherwise, I wouldn't have made it back.

125
00:10:33,399 --> 00:10:34,919
Where do you want to go? I'll drive you.

126
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:39,320
Back to the hotel.

127
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:40,879
I just want to get some good sleep.

128
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:42,559
Let's go.

129
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,159
Watch your step.

130
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:50,919
Here.

131
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,639
I'll walk you inside.

132
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:56,840
No need.

133
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,399
I don't want to cause any more trouble.

134
00:11:01,519 --> 00:11:02,919
Are you sure you're all right?

135
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,639
I'm fine.

136
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,440
This is my home turf, anyway.

137
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:12,840
Manager An, you're back.

138
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,039
Nan Sheng.

139
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,440
Are you all right?

140
00:11:16,679 --> 00:11:17,399
Here, let me take that for you.

141
00:11:17,399 --> 00:11:18,879
It's fine, I barely have anything.

142
00:11:19,919 --> 00:11:20,879
I thought it over.

143
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:23,519
It's more convenient to stay at the hotel.

144
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:24,240
That's true.

145
00:11:24,759 --> 00:11:25,720
Could you get a room for me?

146
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,120
Sure, let's go.

147
00:11:32,279 --> 00:11:33,080
Thanks.

148
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:44,240
How do you like this room?

149
00:11:44,279 --> 00:11:45,480
It was just finished today.

150
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:49,240
Guest traffic has finally picked up lately.

151
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:50,480
Really?

152
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,279
Yeah, much better than expected.

153
00:11:55,159 --> 00:11:55,960
Manager An...

154
00:11:56,559 --> 00:11:58,320
Are you feeling sick?

155
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,759
You don't look so well.

156
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:03,519
No, I'm just exhausted lately.

157
00:12:03,519 --> 00:12:05,000
I'll be fine after some rest.

158
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:08,000
Okay, get some good rest first.

159
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:08,919
I'll head downstairs now.

160
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,000
Call me if you need anything.

161
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,240
The keycard is right here.

162
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,159
Thanks.

163
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:12,879
See you.

164
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:39,799
Where's Anda?

165
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,279
Where is she?

166
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,840
The mission's over, why are you still looking for her?

167
00:12:44,879 --> 00:12:46,240
She was injured during the mission.

168
00:12:46,279 --> 00:12:47,200
I can't just ignore that.

169
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:49,240
She couldn't even handle a few harsh words.

170
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,840
She doesn't belong here at all.

171
00:12:52,799 --> 00:12:54,519
You're usually so sharp-tongued.

172
00:12:54,519 --> 00:12:56,120
I don't believe you couldn't talk her into staying.

173
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:58,879
What could I do?

174
00:12:58,879 --> 00:12:59,679
She's got two legs of her own.

175
00:12:59,679 --> 00:13:01,279
She comes and goes as she pleases.

176
00:13:02,039 --> 00:13:03,480
You're just flattering yourself.

177
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,279
She doesn't care about you at all.

178
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,279
Where is she?

179
00:13:22,559 --> 00:13:23,720
How is she doing?

180
00:13:25,519 --> 00:13:26,480
She's not doing so well.

181
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:29,080
I took her back to the hotel to rest.

182
00:15:06,639 --> 00:15:09,000
They want us to set up the conference room.

183
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,600
I've already arranged for someone to do it.

184
00:15:11,039 --> 00:15:12,960
"Arrange, arrange. Set up, set up."

185
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,440
Arranging things is all you ever do.

186
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:17,120
You should've pitched the multipurpose hall to them!

187
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,759
The rent for the multipurpose hall

188
00:15:18,759 --> 00:15:20,159
is twice as much as the conference room!

189
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:21,559
Every day you yell,

190
00:15:21,559 --> 00:15:22,960
"I want to boost sales! I want to boost sales!"

191
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,840
Boosting sales isn't just lip service.

192
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,000
You have to use your head.

193
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,039
Let me ask you.

194
00:15:27,039 --> 00:15:28,440
If you don't pitch the multipurpose hall,

195
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,879
how would they even know about it?

196
00:15:29,879 --> 00:15:30,039
I...

197
00:15:30,039 --> 00:15:30,960
If they don't know about it,

198
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,960
how are they going to pay for it?

199
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,559
And if they don't pay rent,

200
00:15:32,559 --> 00:15:33,519
how are you going to improve your numbers?

201
00:15:33,519 --> 00:15:34,600
I did recommend it.

202
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,720
They said the conference room was enough.

203
00:15:38,679 --> 00:15:39,960
Then you could've told them!

204
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:40,879
Tell them that in the conference room,

205
00:15:40,879 --> 00:15:42,159
look, the projector is broken,

206
00:15:42,159 --> 00:15:43,440
and the sound system isn't working, right?

207
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,279
It's been fixed, though.

208
00:15:45,279 --> 00:15:46,759
Why are you so dense?

209
00:15:46,919 --> 00:15:48,000
Couldn't you just bluff them?

210
00:15:50,399 --> 00:15:51,679
Fine, I get it, I get it.

211
00:15:51,679 --> 00:15:52,759
I'll tell them

212
00:15:52,759 --> 00:15:55,200
our conference room equipment is outdated,

213
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:57,440
the projector is broken,

214
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:59,679
and the sound quality is terrible, right?

215
00:15:59,759 --> 00:16:01,360
Spot on. Just like that.

216
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:02,960
I'll go set up the multipurpose hall right away,

217
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,480
and then call the client, okay?

218
00:16:04,919 --> 00:16:05,720
Go ahead.

219
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:07,360
I wanted to ask you,

220
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,960
which room is Anda in?

221
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:12,120
Room 305.

222
00:16:12,799 --> 00:16:13,600
Thanks.

223
00:16:16,279 --> 00:16:18,039
When did she check into our hotel?

224
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,879
She didn't look well, so she booked a room

225
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:20,879
and stayed here.

226
00:16:21,759 --> 00:16:22,840
Did she pay for the room, then?

227
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,519
Are you crazy?

228
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:28,440
Business is business.

229
00:16:30,519 --> 00:16:31,320
Anda.

230
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:35,879
Anda.

231
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,240
Anda!

232
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,159
Why are you sleeping here?

233
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,399
What are you doing here?

234
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,880
My friend has a high fever.

235
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,440
Can you give her an IV to bring down the fever?

236
00:17:08,599 --> 00:17:10,119
If it's a high fever,

237
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,559
before we know the cause,

238
00:17:11,559 --> 00:17:12,960
we can't treat her.

239
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,240
Then find out the cause as soon as possible.

240
00:17:15,319 --> 00:17:16,119
Okay.

241
00:17:22,079 --> 00:17:23,160
Where did you take her?

242
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:26,319
We're at the hospital. She has a fever.

243
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:29,079
This hospital won't give her an IV.

244
00:17:29,079 --> 00:17:30,519
What about going to a bigger hospital?

245
00:17:31,079 --> 00:17:32,839
Okay. Come pick pick us up.

246
00:17:57,799 --> 00:17:58,160
Here.

247
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:58,640
Thanks.

248
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:03,000
Even after moving to a big hospital,

249
00:18:03,319 --> 00:18:05,240
her high fever still won't go down.

250
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,799
How about this? Send those lab results

251
00:18:07,799 --> 00:18:09,000
over so I can take a look.

252
00:18:10,119 --> 00:18:10,920
Okay.

253
00:18:15,839 --> 00:18:17,960
Judging from the lab report, that's true.

254
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,440
When she was injured,

255
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,880
her wound wasn't cleaned properly.

256
00:18:21,039 --> 00:18:22,240
Plus, her immunity is weak,

257
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,359
and she hasn't rested enough.

258
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:26,240
That's how young girls are.

259
00:18:26,359 --> 00:18:28,640
Always running around instead of staying home,

260
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,200
ending up like this.

261
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,519
Did they change her dressing?

262
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,480
Remember to use hydrogen peroxide and saline

263
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,440
to clean the wound.

264
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,519
I think there's a specific cure...

265
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:52,039
Xiang Lai.

266
00:18:53,359 --> 00:18:54,599
Here's her blood test report.

267
00:18:54,599 --> 00:18:56,200
I heard there's only one medicine

268
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,519
that can cure her illness.

269
00:18:58,079 --> 00:18:58,880
What medicine?

270
00:19:01,559 --> 00:19:02,359
Wei Tian.

271
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,680
Why don't I have my driver take you?

272
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,279
The tribe folks recognize my car,

273
00:19:06,279 --> 00:19:07,359
but they don't know you.

274
00:19:08,559 --> 00:19:09,799
I just don't want anyone to know

275
00:19:09,799 --> 00:19:10,799
that you're helping me.

276
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:13,759
Grace was right about this.

277
00:19:14,079 --> 00:19:15,720
My men used up all the medicine

278
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:16,839
without even saying a word.

279
00:19:16,839 --> 00:19:17,920
The new batch hasn't arrived yet,

280
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:20,039
so I have to trouble you to go.

281
00:19:20,119 --> 00:19:21,039
No trouble at all.

282
00:19:21,319 --> 00:19:22,559
But I really couldn't have guessed

283
00:19:22,559 --> 00:19:24,720
you'd keep your medicine in that place.

284
00:19:25,559 --> 00:19:26,960
The most dangerous place

285
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:28,839
is the safest place.

286
00:19:30,359 --> 00:19:31,160
Understood.

287
00:19:31,799 --> 00:19:32,599
I'm off.

288
00:19:33,079 --> 00:19:33,880
Alright.

289
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:42,440
This is so fun.

290
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,559
Let me try.

291
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:45,599
You try it too.

292
00:19:45,599 --> 00:19:46,400
You try it too.

293
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:46,839
So much fun!

294
00:19:46,839 --> 00:19:47,680
Really interesting.

295
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:53,359
Heavily guarded with tight security.

296
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:54,480
Okay.

297
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:56,960
You come too.

298
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,920
I need to put this inside in a bit,

299
00:20:01,319 --> 00:20:03,440
or else they'll eat it.

300
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,599
Valuable things in the tribe

301
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:08,279
are guarded by ferocious beasts.

302
00:20:08,599 --> 00:20:10,839
Like tigers, leopards,

303
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,720
and hyenas.

304
00:20:13,119 --> 00:20:14,279
Stay safe.

305
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:31,920
Let me go!

306
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:40,759
Let me go!

307
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:43,440
Is anyone there?

308
00:20:50,599 --> 00:20:53,279
Great, you got here just in time.

309
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:55,000
Someone just tried to steal medicine.

310
00:20:55,640 --> 00:20:57,640
He had this on him, too.

311
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,640
What do you plan to do with him?

312
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:03,200
All thieves should be burned to death.

313
00:21:04,759 --> 00:21:07,079
When will it be carried out?

314
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,319
In three days.

315
00:21:09,599 --> 00:21:11,359
At midnight on the third day.

316
00:21:15,079 --> 00:21:17,720
This is for you, my friend.

317
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:20,039
Thank you.

318
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,480
Let me go!

319
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:43,759
Let go!

320
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:23,519
Here you go.

321
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:28,240
Thanks.

322
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:39,079
Thank you

323
00:23:39,400 --> 00:23:40,279
You were dreaming.

324
00:23:40,759 --> 00:23:42,160
You seemed happy in your dream.

325
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:45,480
Smiling even when you're sick. That's good.

326
00:23:47,079 --> 00:23:49,160
I... dreamed about...

327
00:23:50,279 --> 00:23:52,119
you and me.

328
00:23:58,039 --> 00:23:59,599
Has the patient woken up yet?

329
00:24:00,759 --> 00:24:01,640
Not yet.

330
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:03,519
We changed her IV drip in the middle of the night.

331
00:24:03,519 --> 00:24:05,240
Her fever broke by morning.

332
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:07,599
She should be waking up soon.

333
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:09,480
That medicine really worked wonders.

334
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:10,680
Of course.

335
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:13,200
Specific medication like that is hard to get.

336
00:24:13,759 --> 00:24:15,079
That man is no ordinary guy.

337
00:24:15,119 --> 00:24:17,319
Be careful with what you say and do.

338
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,559
Whatever you do, don't cross him.

339
00:24:22,279 --> 00:24:23,359
Let's take this fruit basket.

340
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:23,960
Okay.

341
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:24,599
Alright.

342
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,240
Here's the money.

343
00:24:30,119 --> 00:24:31,519
Captain, let's go.

344
00:24:32,119 --> 00:24:33,119
What's the rush?

345
00:24:33,119 --> 00:24:35,119
Isn't Anda safe right now?

346
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:37,519
I'm just worried she might pass the illness to Wei Tian.

347
00:24:37,559 --> 00:24:39,000
Let's go. We should hurry to the hospital and check.

348
00:24:52,680 --> 00:24:54,480
Please be gentle, be gentle.

349
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,119
Okay.

350
00:25:01,279 --> 00:25:03,240
Did we come at a bad time?

351
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:06,359
What brings you guys here?

352
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:08,279
We wrapped up early today,

353
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:09,519
so we came by to see you.

354
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:12,440
You have no idea.

355
00:25:13,039 --> 00:25:15,640
Once Sha Lan heard you had a fever,

356
00:25:16,279 --> 00:25:17,240
she couldn't sit still.

357
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,920
She dragged all of us here to see you.

358
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:20,480
I—

359
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:24,400
Don't worry.

360
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:25,880
My health hasn't been great,

361
00:25:25,880 --> 00:25:27,519
but thanks for coming to see me.

362
00:25:27,839 --> 00:25:29,240
You look good today.

363
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,279
You must be feeling better, right?

364
00:25:30,799 --> 00:25:32,920
Yeah, the doctor said the fever broke.

365
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:34,839
As long as it doesn't return tonight, I'll be fine.

366
00:25:37,599 --> 00:25:39,799
By the way, is there any of that miracle medicine left?

367
00:25:39,799 --> 00:25:41,880
I want to look into what ingredients are in it.

368
00:25:43,279 --> 00:25:44,119
It's all gone.

369
00:25:46,279 --> 00:25:47,079
I have some here.

370
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:51,000
Where did you get this medicine?

371
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:54,519
He got it by telling the chief...

372
00:25:54,519 --> 00:25:55,640
...he'd trade his belt...

373
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:58,200
...for an Avatar look.

374
00:26:01,559 --> 00:26:04,000
Don't listen to his nonsense. What chief?

375
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:33,920
Looks like you're doing fine, huh?

376
00:26:35,039 --> 00:26:37,519
You just like lying in bed

377
00:26:37,519 --> 00:26:38,759
and being looked after.

378
00:26:40,359 --> 00:26:41,160
Not at all.

379
00:26:42,519 --> 00:26:44,000
Wei Tian, Wei Tian!

380
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:44,480
Don't.

381
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:45,240
Wei Tian!

382
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:47,960
I'm... I'm really all better.

383
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:49,920
Let me say it, let me say it!

384
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:50,480
What's wrong?

385
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:51,599
Nothing.

386
00:26:52,359 --> 00:26:53,559
I brought Anda

387
00:26:53,559 --> 00:26:55,400
her favorite seafood pizza.

388
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:57,039
It's absolutely delicious.

389
00:26:57,759 --> 00:27:00,359
Yeah, yeah, it smells amazing.

390
00:27:00,359 --> 00:27:01,519
I love it.

391
00:27:01,599 --> 00:27:03,839
I feel like I can leave the hospital now.

392
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:04,839
I'm completely recovered.

393
00:27:04,839 --> 00:27:06,039
Even the nurse said so.

394
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:09,839
I just called a nurse for you.

395
00:27:10,039 --> 00:27:11,279
I thought you were in pain.

396
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:13,119
No need, I really...

397
00:27:13,119 --> 00:27:14,279
Because of this pizza,

398
00:27:14,279 --> 00:27:16,160
I feel totally healed.

399
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:17,319
It... it smells so good.

400
00:27:18,559 --> 00:27:20,119
Weren't you complaining about a headache?

401
00:27:20,759 --> 00:27:22,960
It's because this pizza smells so good!

402
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:24,519
It doesn't... doesn't hurt one bit.

403
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:25,480
Have some.

404
00:27:26,000 --> 00:27:27,279
I... I'm not having any!

405
00:27:27,599 --> 00:27:28,279
It's so good.

406
00:27:28,279 --> 00:27:29,240
Pretty lively in here, huh?

407
00:27:29,839 --> 00:27:31,119
One look and you can tell she's all better.

408
00:27:42,279 --> 00:27:43,079
What's wrong?

409
00:27:44,240 --> 00:27:46,160
I just looked into that pharma company

410
00:27:46,799 --> 00:27:48,599
and found that their books,

411
00:27:48,759 --> 00:27:50,400
though kept meticulously,

412
00:27:50,839 --> 00:27:52,680
still feel like something is off.

413
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:56,359
Which means this pharma company

414
00:27:57,119 --> 00:27:58,680
is trying to hide something.

415
00:27:58,680 --> 00:27:59,720
Definitely.

416
00:28:00,200 --> 00:28:02,599
But we don't have any evidence.

417
00:28:03,839 --> 00:28:04,400
By the way,

418
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:06,519
one thing is for sure.

419
00:28:07,279 --> 00:28:09,079
Someone's been tailing you lately.

420
00:28:11,079 --> 00:28:12,200
Tailing me?

421
00:28:13,359 --> 00:28:15,680
Aside from Hades and Deep Sea,

422
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,599
it couldn't be anyone else.

423
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:19,480
But I don't think it's Deep Sea.

424
00:28:19,759 --> 00:28:21,359
According to their rules,

425
00:28:21,839 --> 00:28:23,200
once you leave them,

426
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:24,839
they won't come after you anymore.

427
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:26,920
It must be Hades.

428
00:29:03,759 --> 00:29:05,039
Pretty quick on your feet.

429
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,440
As expected of Zhong'an.

430
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:08,000
You flatter me, Captain.

431
00:29:08,039 --> 00:29:10,319
I was merely showing off before an expert.

432
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:12,279
Let's cut the crap.

433
00:29:12,279 --> 00:29:14,960
Tell me, why were you tailing Wei Tian?

434
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:17,720
Well, as competitors...

435
00:29:17,720 --> 00:29:19,400
...it pays to learn more about the other side.

436
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:22,000
Did Xiang Lai send you?

437
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:23,799
No, he has nothing to do with this.

438
00:29:23,799 --> 00:29:25,079
It was my own decision.

439
00:29:27,279 --> 00:29:28,079
Shen Yu...

440
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:30,440
If you have questions in the future,

441
00:29:30,519 --> 00:29:31,640
come ask me directly.

442
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:32,880
I'll tell you whatever I know.

443
00:29:33,799 --> 00:29:34,200
Really?

444
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:36,640
Then I'd like to ask:

445
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:37,440
How did you know

446
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:39,039
that pharmaceutical company was dirty?

447
00:29:40,799 --> 00:29:42,839
The investigation files on that

448
00:29:42,960 --> 00:29:44,559
have already been submitted to your boss,

449
00:29:44,559 --> 00:29:45,599
Xiang Pingsheng.

450
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:46,920
You can ask him directly.

451
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:49,319
Never mind, then.

452
00:29:49,680 --> 00:29:50,359
All your intel...

453
00:29:50,359 --> 00:29:52,039
...is stuff we've already investigated.

454
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:55,319
Look...

455
00:29:55,319 --> 00:29:57,240
When you walked down this street,

456
00:29:57,599 --> 00:29:59,799
you were completely out of place.

457
00:29:59,799 --> 00:30:00,119
Was I?

458
00:30:00,119 --> 00:30:03,359
Look, everyone else is relaxed,

459
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,720
but the moment you showed up,

460
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:07,440
you were radiating tension.

461
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,240
Truth is,

462
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,799
Wei Tian spotted you a long time ago.

463
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,599
Experience really wins out.

464
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:20,920
Thanks for the pointer.

465
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:23,440
Well, I won't bother you anymore.

466
00:30:23,839 --> 00:30:24,279
All right.

467
00:30:24,759 --> 00:30:25,559
Goodbye.

468
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:48,119
Mr. Xiang, you're here.

469
00:30:48,799 --> 00:30:49,440
Where's Manager An?

470
00:30:51,519 --> 00:30:52,599
Mr. Xiao is waiting for you.

471
00:31:03,720 --> 00:31:05,519
Mr. Xiang, welcome, welcome. Welcome to you all!

472
00:31:06,680 --> 00:31:08,119
From now on, the Plato Hotel's...

473
00:31:08,119 --> 00:31:09,839
...entire staff in Antilocaris,

474
00:31:09,839 --> 00:31:11,200
and the safety of all our guests,

475
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:12,480
will be completely in your hands.

476
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:13,519
Rest assured, Mr. Xiao.

477
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,359
Thank you for coming. Come on,

478
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,559
let's go sign the contract with Anda.

479
00:31:16,559 --> 00:31:17,720
Mr. Xiang, right this way.

480
00:32:00,799 --> 00:32:01,599
Boss.

481
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:03,039
What's going on?

482
00:32:03,839 --> 00:32:06,279
Looks like Zhong'an Group took the Plato contract.

483
00:32:06,880 --> 00:32:07,680
Zhong'an?

484
00:32:09,799 --> 00:32:10,880
Only an idiot

485
00:32:10,880 --> 00:32:12,799
would take on Plato's business right now.

486
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:15,359
They're holding the signing ceremony right now.

487
00:32:18,599 --> 00:32:19,400
Let me see.

488
00:32:19,759 --> 00:32:20,640
Boss, look.

489
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:30,200
How dare he steal my business!

490
00:32:32,039 --> 00:32:35,039
He can forget about doing business around here anymore.

491
00:32:51,759 --> 00:32:53,359
Stop training. Take a break.

492
00:32:54,039 --> 00:32:55,839
I just watched a great speech.

493
00:32:57,079 --> 00:32:59,480
Zhong'an sure talks big.

494
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:01,680
Protecting overseas Chinese worldwide

495
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:03,599
is its duty and mission.

496
00:33:04,119 --> 00:33:05,599
If he can keep his company running

497
00:33:05,599 --> 00:33:06,480
here in Antilocaris,

498
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:07,519
I'll be genuinely impressed.

499
00:33:08,279 --> 00:33:10,000
Zhong'an Group is dedicated to

500
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:12,359
securing overseas enterprises.

501
00:33:12,720 --> 00:33:14,079
What a speech.

502
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:15,240
Totally pulled all the aggro.

503
00:33:16,559 --> 00:33:17,359
Tell me,

504
00:33:17,799 --> 00:33:20,119
will Bito retaliate against Plato first,

505
00:33:20,359 --> 00:33:21,839
or strike Zhong'an?

506
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:25,359
Killing two birds with one stone is Kwame's style.

507
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:27,599
Makes sense.

508
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:35,920
There's one thing.

509
00:33:36,640 --> 00:33:39,799
I wonder how you Silent Protectors see it.

510
00:33:40,039 --> 00:33:40,880
What is it?

511
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:45,240
Zhong'an signing the deal with Plato Hotel.

512
00:33:46,960 --> 00:33:48,440
In Antilocaris,

513
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:49,519
Bito

514
00:33:49,559 --> 00:33:51,759
is an established security firm.

515
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:54,440
Would they care about a deal like this?

516
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,720
They're completely out of line.

517
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:59,160
They ignored the local situation

518
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:02,119
and the feelings of friends like us.

519
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:04,119
Without saying a single word,

520
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:06,279
they went ahead and signed with the hotel.

521
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:12,320
It's just Chinese protecting Chinese.

522
00:34:12,320 --> 00:34:13,559
There's nothing wrong with that.

523
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:16,320
Besides, Zhong'an moving into Plato

524
00:34:16,559 --> 00:34:18,760
won't affect the partnership

525
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:20,000
between you and the hotel.

526
00:34:20,719 --> 00:34:21,760
Just like us.

527
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:22,800
It's different.

528
00:34:25,039 --> 00:34:27,440
Wei Tian and I aren't just good friends,

529
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:29,679
we're drinking buddies.

530
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:32,800
I'd never betray a friendship like that.

531
00:34:35,519 --> 00:34:37,760
I'll be sure to pass that on to Wei Tian.

532
00:34:39,559 --> 00:34:41,039
As for Zhong'an's prospects,

533
00:34:41,639 --> 00:34:42,480
what do you think?

534
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:45,519
Zhong'an is a capable company.

535
00:34:45,920 --> 00:34:47,280
They're fully capable

536
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:49,920
of setting up branches worldwide.

537
00:34:50,760 --> 00:34:52,480
But have you considered

538
00:34:52,880 --> 00:34:54,840
that they'll take business from us too?

539
00:34:56,039 --> 00:34:57,840
Pingsheng and I are good friends.

540
00:35:00,239 --> 00:35:01,079
They won't.

541
00:35:03,239 --> 00:35:05,159
Still, they're newcomers.

542
00:35:05,159 --> 00:35:07,639
Do you think they can handle everything here?

543
00:35:08,960 --> 00:35:10,800
If something really happens,

544
00:35:11,639 --> 00:35:12,960
we must help each other out.

545
00:35:14,719 --> 00:35:15,199
Right.

546
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:23,480
Thanks.

547
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:24,400
Let's go.

548
00:35:51,559 --> 00:35:52,000
Please.

549
00:36:00,599 --> 00:36:01,119
Mr. Xiao,

550
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:02,760
could you come to the front desk?

551
00:36:04,920 --> 00:36:06,639
A difficult group of guests just arrived.

552
00:36:07,519 --> 00:36:08,159
Got it.

553
00:36:12,719 --> 00:36:13,800
Anda, let's go.

554
00:36:14,079 --> 00:36:14,880
Come to the lobby with me.

555
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:22,119
Hello, sir. Welcome.

556
00:36:22,519 --> 00:36:24,639
How can I help you today?

557
00:36:25,159 --> 00:36:25,960
Rooms.

558
00:36:26,239 --> 00:36:27,559
Every room on the top floor.

559
00:36:28,119 --> 00:36:28,679
For five days.

560
00:36:30,719 --> 00:36:31,440
Well, you see...

561
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:33,079
as for our current vacancy,

562
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:34,639
we're completely booked.

563
00:36:35,239 --> 00:36:36,199
There is another way, though.

564
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:37,719
We could help you reach out to

565
00:36:37,719 --> 00:36:38,599
nearby hotels.

566
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:40,519
They're very nice as well.

567
00:36:42,079 --> 00:36:44,039
Here's the deposit and service fee.

568
00:36:49,519 --> 00:36:52,400
Sir, we really are fully booked.

569
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:53,800
If you'd like,

570
00:36:54,199 --> 00:36:56,639
we can help find a place for you.

571
00:37:11,199 --> 00:37:13,079
Boss, it's done.

572
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:21,159
Excuse me, I need to take this call.

573
00:37:23,079 --> 00:37:25,199
Mr. Xiao, I'm at the market right now.

574
00:37:25,519 --> 00:37:27,039
Right after I bought the groceries,

575
00:37:27,039 --> 00:37:28,039
a bunch of guys rushed over

576
00:37:28,039 --> 00:37:30,000
and smashed them all on the ground!

577
00:37:30,400 --> 00:37:31,119
What should I do?

578
00:37:31,119 --> 00:37:33,199
Such good produce, all ruined!

579
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:34,400
What do you think?

580
00:37:34,639 --> 00:37:36,280
Go buy from another market!

581
00:37:36,639 --> 00:37:38,519
If you delay our guests' dinner today,

582
00:37:38,519 --> 00:37:39,320
just you wait!

583
00:37:39,320 --> 00:37:39,920
No, Mr. Xiao,

584
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:41,360
I just feel like this whole thing...

585
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,400
feels kind of strange.

586
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:43,400
Don't worry about that right now.

587
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,559
Just get the groceries first!

588
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:51,599
Mr. Xiao, do you know who these people are?

589
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:55,920
Do you have any idea?

590
00:37:56,599 --> 00:37:58,760
They're with the local chamber of commerce.

591
00:37:58,840 --> 00:37:59,800
They're very powerful.

592
00:38:00,239 --> 00:38:01,559
We can't afford to cross them.

593
00:38:01,840 --> 00:38:03,719
Then... should we just leave the money there?

594
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:06,400
I... I'll figure something out.

595
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:10,239
If we don't want them checking in,

596
00:38:10,440 --> 00:38:11,800
return their money.

597
00:38:12,719 --> 00:38:13,679
No, no, no.

598
00:38:14,119 --> 00:38:15,320
Why not let Mr. Xiang handle this?

599
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:16,519
No, no, no.

600
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:17,639
Wait, wait, wait.

601
00:38:19,599 --> 00:38:21,719
I just have a feeling...

602
00:38:22,679 --> 00:38:24,440
something is bound to happen.

603
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:32,199
Mr. Xiao!

604
00:38:33,559 --> 00:38:35,320
I just asked several other vendors,

605
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:37,000
and no one will sell to us!

606
00:38:37,159 --> 00:38:39,199
And the strangest thing is,

607
00:38:39,239 --> 00:38:41,280
they didn't hit or curse at me,

608
00:38:41,679 --> 00:38:43,679
they just flatly refuse to sell to me.

609
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:47,599
How weird is that?

610
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:50,880
All right, I got it.

611
00:38:52,079 --> 00:38:53,960
Don't go anywhere right now.

612
00:38:54,119 --> 00:38:56,679
Stay put and wait for my call.

613
00:38:58,679 --> 00:38:59,280
How is it?

614
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:08,000
Sir, here's the arrangement.

615
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:09,920
When would you like to check in?

616
00:39:10,159 --> 00:39:12,159
Are all top-floor rooms cleared out?

617
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:14,960
It depends on your check-in time.

618
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:15,880
Only then can we arrange it.

619
00:39:16,400 --> 00:39:17,599
Seven o'clock tonight.

620
00:39:18,159 --> 00:39:20,840
Every single room must be cleared out.

621
00:39:21,360 --> 00:39:23,000
Reserve the top-floor conference room.

622
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:25,239
As for our meals and preparation,

623
00:39:25,840 --> 00:39:27,239
someone will instruct the kitchen.

624
00:39:27,719 --> 00:39:29,199
We'll need two servers on the top floor.

625
00:39:29,480 --> 00:39:30,760
Submit their profiles to me for review.

626
00:39:32,679 --> 00:39:33,480
Mr. Xiao,

627
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:35,840
looking forward to working together.

628
00:39:35,880 --> 00:39:37,320
A pleasure doing business with you.

629
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:45,559
What is it now?

630
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:47,239
Mr. Xiao, some people showed up.

631
00:39:47,239 --> 00:39:48,960
They brought vegetables, fruit, and meat,

632
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:50,320
and loaded it all onto our truck!

633
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:51,719
They kept apologizing non-stop,

634
00:39:51,719 --> 00:39:52,960
saying it was a mistake

635
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:54,280
and offering this as compensation.

636
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:55,920
Can I take it?

637
00:39:56,159 --> 00:39:58,039
Take it! Of course you take it!

638
00:39:58,039 --> 00:39:58,679
You idiot!

639
00:40:02,719 --> 00:40:03,559
How did it go?

640
00:40:11,639 --> 00:40:13,360
Nan Sheng, here, take this money.

641
00:40:14,239 --> 00:40:15,119
Take it.

642
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:20,639
Now I just pray to God

643
00:40:21,119 --> 00:40:22,920
that nothing else goes wrong.

644
00:40:23,880 --> 00:40:25,280
If you're so scared of them,

645
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:27,199
why let them check in?

646
00:40:28,360 --> 00:40:29,480
You don't understand.

647
00:40:29,639 --> 00:40:31,440
Here in Antilocaris,

648
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:35,599
this chamber of commerce holds immense power.

649
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:37,400
The only thing we can do right now

650
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:39,880
is try to coexist peacefully with them.

651
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:41,199
Don't you know by now?

652
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:42,880
In Antilocaris,

653
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:45,679
every aspect of our lives

654
00:40:46,320 --> 00:40:47,199
is under their control.

655
00:40:47,199 --> 00:40:48,079
That includes our hotel;

656
00:40:48,079 --> 00:40:49,559
it's entirely within their domain.

657
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:52,920
So if we want to survive and make a living,

658
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:54,840
we have to do what they say.

659
00:40:56,079 --> 00:41:00,519
But the top floor is for VIPs.

660
00:41:00,519 --> 00:41:03,440
Kicking them out wouldn't look good.

661
00:41:03,920 --> 00:41:06,039
I don't care. Figure it out yourself.

662
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,199
Before seven o'clock,

663
00:41:07,199 --> 00:41:09,119
have all those rooms cleared for me. Got it?

664
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:15,400
Yes, sir.

665
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:17,639
What a brainless boss, all talk and no sense.

666
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:19,599
Dumping every headache on us.

667
00:41:20,360 --> 00:41:21,039
Wei Tian.

668
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:24,400
The Plato Hotel is the best hotel in town.

669
00:41:25,079 --> 00:41:26,880
Its amenities are top-tier,

670
00:41:27,760 --> 00:41:28,800
and the service is impeccable.

671
00:41:30,159 --> 00:41:31,159
Most importantly,

672
00:41:31,800 --> 00:41:32,599
I've got the money,

673
00:41:33,159 --> 00:41:34,239
and I like staying here.

674
00:41:34,559 --> 00:41:35,199
Understood.

675
00:41:36,480 --> 00:41:39,159
There's another advantage to this hotel.

676
00:41:39,559 --> 00:41:40,920
It's Chinese-owned.

677
00:41:41,280 --> 00:41:43,519
Its security has Zhong'an Group

678
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:45,119
backed by the Silent Protectors.

679
00:41:46,320 --> 00:41:48,679
To you, that's double the protection.

680
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:50,960
Think whatever you want,

681
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:52,840
but you know

682
00:41:53,199 --> 00:41:54,639
you're the person I trust most.

683
00:41:55,639 --> 00:41:56,840
Otherwise, I wouldn't have tasked you

684
00:41:56,920 --> 00:41:58,880
with the crucial mission of guarding Wilson.

685
00:41:59,840 --> 00:42:01,440
Come on, cheers.

686
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:08,280
The top-floor rooms have all been cleared.

687
00:42:08,280 --> 00:42:10,280
Now we're just waiting for them to check in.

688
00:42:10,760 --> 00:42:12,920
Still, who they've crossed

689
00:42:12,960 --> 00:42:13,880
is anyone's guess.

690
00:42:14,079 --> 00:42:15,800
What if their enemies come after them here?

691
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:18,679
If we refuse to let them stay,

692
00:42:18,719 --> 00:42:20,960
we'll become their worst enemies instead.

693
00:42:21,760 --> 00:42:23,559
The company has already looked into them.

694
00:42:23,800 --> 00:42:26,079
Their organization is quite complex,

695
00:42:26,599 --> 00:42:27,760
and their footprint

696
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:29,519
spans nearly every industry.

697
00:42:30,159 --> 00:42:31,679
Their leader, Wilson,

698
00:42:32,000 --> 00:42:33,079
known as the Black-Faced God,

699
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:34,719
has operated in Africa for years.

700
00:42:34,719 --> 00:42:36,679
He runs a massive chamber of commerce,

701
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:38,360
making plenty of enemies along the way.

702
00:42:38,440 --> 00:42:39,920
They booked the conference room this time,

703
00:42:40,159 --> 00:42:41,719
likely to discuss something big.

704
00:42:43,880 --> 00:42:45,559
With so many hotels out there,

705
00:42:45,559 --> 00:42:47,360
why pick the Plato Hotel of all places?

706
00:42:47,559 --> 00:42:49,000
The Plato is Chinese-owned,

707
00:42:49,119 --> 00:42:50,039
and the guests staying here

708
00:42:50,039 --> 00:42:51,800
are overwhelmingly Chinese.

709
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:53,320
Enemies won't dare attack openly here.

710
00:42:53,519 --> 00:42:54,719
If things escalate into gunfire,

711
00:42:54,880 --> 00:42:56,280
it turns into an international incident.

712
00:42:56,880 --> 00:42:58,039
That makes sense.

713
00:42:58,199 --> 00:43:01,239
That's why they only booked a single floor,

714
00:43:01,239 --> 00:43:02,400
instead of the entire building.

715
00:43:02,400 --> 00:43:03,159
Exactly.
